WEBVTT

00:08.967 --> 00:10.969
[dramatic music playing]

00:20.020 --> 00:21.980
So this is the place?

00:22.856 --> 00:23.898
[Baku] Mm-hm.

00:25.567 --> 00:26.609
[sighs]

00:27.152 --> 00:29.446
Maybe it was a bad idea to come see it.

00:30.655 --> 00:32.032
I'm getting kinda nervous.

00:33.324 --> 00:35.201
Those Union shitheads outnumber us.

00:36.077 --> 00:37.454
[Baku] Hey, my man.

00:38.705 --> 00:40.707
I'm gonna be here, so don't worry, bro.

00:40.790 --> 00:44.586
They're all dead meat when
I get my hands on these idiots. [chuckles]

00:44.669 --> 00:48.381
[Gotak] Dumbass.
You gonna take 'em all on? Huh?

00:49.883 --> 00:51.384
Let's push it a few days.

00:52.469 --> 00:53.595
Hmm?

00:54.846 --> 00:57.974
We need to come up
with a plan so we can win.

00:58.058 --> 00:59.809
[optimistic music playing]

01:02.520 --> 01:03.897
Who's the person

01:05.315 --> 01:07.692
Na Baek-jin trusts most in the Union?

01:11.071 --> 01:12.405
[slurps loudly]

01:13.782 --> 01:14.991
Mmm.

01:18.244 --> 01:19.412
Hey. [sniffs]

01:20.080 --> 01:21.122
Before,

01:21.956 --> 01:24.959
remember when you, like,
stabbed the top of my foot?

01:25.043 --> 01:26.252
[chuckles]

01:26.961 --> 01:29.005
I had to get a fucking tetanus shot.

01:30.799 --> 01:33.218
[sighs] Sorry about that.

01:35.512 --> 01:36.721
[Seong-je chuckles]

01:37.388 --> 01:39.432
You're freaking sentimental, aren't you?

01:40.433 --> 01:42.519
Yeah, whatever. [clears throat]

01:43.186 --> 01:44.395
So you're saying

01:45.313 --> 01:48.983
the Union has a bank account
under a fake identity? Hmm?

01:49.984 --> 01:52.112
You think I have the account info, right?

01:52.862 --> 01:54.948
And you want me to be the squeaky wheel.

01:57.575 --> 02:00.995
[tuts] Then what
do I fucking get in return?

02:02.455 --> 02:04.791
[Si-eun] You could've
been blamed for everything.

02:05.917 --> 02:10.130
When the Union collapses,
the criminal evidence disappears too.

02:11.339 --> 02:12.841
You'd benefit from that.

02:14.259 --> 02:15.385
[chuckles]

02:16.636 --> 02:19.222
I knew you'd be a fucking psycho, hmm?

02:19.305 --> 02:21.432
The second I saw you. [scoffs]

02:23.977 --> 02:24.978
Okay.

02:26.771 --> 02:27.772
Cool.

02:31.609 --> 02:33.027
[suspenseful music playing]

02:33.111 --> 02:34.779
[Seong-je slurping]

02:37.323 --> 02:38.324
Where are you going?

02:42.203 --> 02:43.413
I have to study

02:44.372 --> 02:47.417
about Na Baek-jin and the Union.

02:47.500 --> 02:48.334
[chuckles]

02:56.259 --> 03:00.555
EUNJANG (UNKNOWN) VS UNION (300 PEOPLE?)
EUNJANG IS OUTNUMBERED, MUST DIVIDE UNION

03:04.142 --> 03:05.310
[sighs]

03:05.393 --> 03:10.023
CONVERT INSIDER: CHOI HYO-MAN

03:11.441 --> 03:12.692
[Si-eun] Hyo-man…

03:12.775 --> 03:13.985
[typing on phone]

03:14.068 --> 03:15.278
…I need your help.

03:15.361 --> 03:17.363
[upbeat music playing]

03:18.156 --> 03:20.617
This fake identity bank account evidence
is from Geum Seong-je.

03:20.700 --> 03:22.785
THIS PONK STILL DOESN'T KNOW
POLICE ARE ONTOO THE UNION

03:22.869 --> 03:24.162
Spread this to the Union members.

03:24.245 --> 03:27.040
NOV 19, BAEK DONG-HA, 3,115,000 WON
NOV 18, KWON HYEOK-JIN, 2,250,000 WON

03:27.123 --> 03:27.999
[boy 1] Look at this.

03:28.583 --> 03:30.126
- We're screwed.
- [boy 2] What is that?

03:30.210 --> 03:32.170
- [boy 1] Baek-jin siphoned money.
- [boy 3] What?

03:32.253 --> 03:33.671
[boy 4] These fucking assholes.

03:33.755 --> 03:36.216
Oh, shit. Hey, fuck this.

03:36.299 --> 03:37.300
Wait, this is real?

03:37.967 --> 03:41.596
[Si-eun] You told me
that the Union was kept together by money.

03:41.679 --> 03:43.264
BAEK-JIN'S BURNER ACCOUMT
POLICE GAT HIM

03:43.348 --> 03:44.724
[boy 5] Na Baek-jin took the money.

03:44.807 --> 03:46.643
- Yeah.
- Let me see that, dumbass.

03:47.518 --> 03:48.978
Na Baek-jin took the money and ran.

03:49.062 --> 03:49.896
HYO-MAN:
YOU MORONS

03:49.979 --> 03:52.482
- I'm fucking jealous of his fucking money.
- We're totally fucked.

03:52.565 --> 03:53.900
ASSHOLE MADE A FORTUNE

03:53.983 --> 03:54.901
What the fuck is this?

03:54.984 --> 03:56.903
[Si-eun] If money
brought the Union together,

03:57.528 --> 03:59.239
money will tear them apart.

04:00.573 --> 04:02.283
GYEONG-SEOK:
WE MIGHT GET SCREWED FOR THIS

04:02.367 --> 04:03.826
HYO-MAN:
LOOKS LIKE IT

04:03.910 --> 04:05.954
- [Si-eun] So do what you do best.
- [sent notification]

04:07.997 --> 04:10.166
- [thud]
- [sighs]

04:10.250 --> 04:11.668
[rope whistling]

04:14.671 --> 04:15.505
[exhales]

04:18.549 --> 04:20.385
[Gotak grunts and sighs]

04:20.969 --> 04:22.136
Aah!

04:23.471 --> 04:24.389
[sighs]

04:25.598 --> 04:29.143
Hey, do you think jumping rope is gonna
make you, like, stronger or what?

04:29.644 --> 04:31.521
Your knees are bad. Shit.

04:32.105 --> 04:33.022
[tuts]

04:33.940 --> 04:35.066
[sighs]

04:36.025 --> 04:38.361
I have to at least
do something to work out.

04:39.404 --> 04:40.405
[scoffs]

04:41.072 --> 04:43.366
You're, like, always thinking, man.

04:46.953 --> 04:48.037
[scoffs]

04:49.122 --> 04:51.165
I think you're the one
who thinks too much.

04:52.417 --> 04:53.418
What?

04:54.961 --> 04:56.421
You're worried about him.

04:58.131 --> 04:59.173
Na Baek-jin.

04:59.257 --> 05:01.259
[poignant music playing]

05:06.055 --> 05:08.641
[young boy] Whoa. Hey, is this your place?

05:09.142 --> 05:10.727
- [church bell ringing]
- Mm-hm.

05:11.227 --> 05:13.938
Whoa! It's hella huge and super fancy.

05:14.689 --> 05:16.607
My house is like freakin' ant poop.

05:16.691 --> 05:18.693
NA BAEK-JIN

05:20.236 --> 05:23.823
Hey, a basketball hoop!
Do you know how to play?

05:23.906 --> 05:24.866
PARK HU-MIN

05:29.746 --> 05:30.997
Loser buys a soda!

05:32.165 --> 05:34.208
Why are you standing there? Hurry up!

05:50.141 --> 05:51.601
[sighs]

05:55.104 --> 05:57.398
[woman] Thank you for the winter jackets.

05:59.525 --> 06:01.235
It's kept the kids warm.

06:02.487 --> 06:03.988
And they love them.

06:06.657 --> 06:07.658
I'm glad.

06:09.952 --> 06:10.912
[sighs]

06:12.330 --> 06:13.414
Baek-jin-a.

06:16.292 --> 06:18.252
[sighs] You don't…

06:19.003 --> 06:21.297
you don't need to send us donations…

06:23.216 --> 06:24.801
every single month.

06:26.886 --> 06:30.473
I never bother to ask
where you got all that money from,

06:33.059 --> 06:34.727
but it's making me worry.

06:41.234 --> 06:42.568
[sighs]

06:44.153 --> 06:45.780
I'll rest and then leave.

06:51.577 --> 06:53.371
["Hero" by Meego playing]

07:08.344 --> 07:11.222
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

08:07.737 --> 08:09.739
[tense music playing]

08:11.532 --> 08:13.534
[thunder crashing]

08:59.830 --> 09:00.831
This is all?

09:01.332 --> 09:03.084
Those assholes all bailed on us.

09:04.335 --> 09:08.422
Everyone's saying the bank accounts we've
been keeping got exposed, or something.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.552
Is everything good with us?

09:16.097 --> 09:18.391
[sighs] Yeon Si-eun.

09:23.479 --> 09:24.647
[phone chimes]

09:32.572 --> 09:35.908
SEONG-JE: THE EVIDENCE AGAINST NA BAEK-JIN
SEEMS TO BE IN THE UNION OFFICE

09:35.992 --> 09:38.452
LET'S GRAB IT NOW WHILE IT'S EMPTY

09:41.247 --> 09:42.540
[exhales shakily]

09:50.423 --> 09:52.008
[bluesy music playing]

09:58.764 --> 10:00.474
[boy 1] Hey, it's my bros!

10:00.558 --> 10:02.226
[laughter and chatter]

10:08.774 --> 10:11.360
Dang, this weather's so awful!

10:12.278 --> 10:14.113
Why didn't you guys check
the weather report?

10:14.196 --> 10:15.990
My shoes are getting wet.

10:16.073 --> 10:19.327
Hey, it's always more fun
to play in the rain, you ass.

10:21.329 --> 10:22.330
Let's go!

10:27.627 --> 10:28.586
Where's Si-eun?

10:28.669 --> 10:29.837
[Jun-tae] Busy signal.

10:30.421 --> 10:31.422
[Gotak] Wonder why.

10:32.965 --> 10:35.259
- He probably met up with Baku first.
- Oh!

10:37.386 --> 10:40.556
- EUNJANG HIGH, LET'S GO
- BAKU

10:40.640 --> 10:42.683
Hey, why are you guys so late?

10:44.060 --> 10:46.062
Everybody's so tense and shit.

10:46.145 --> 10:47.355
[laughter]

10:47.438 --> 10:48.522
[Hyo-man] Hey, so?

10:49.565 --> 10:54.278
Are you guys ready to annihilate
these stupid-ass Union shits or what?

10:55.279 --> 10:56.947
[Gotak] Hey, why are you even here?

10:57.531 --> 11:00.159
Did you forget you tried
to sell Eunjang to the Union?

11:00.743 --> 11:03.537
- You're trying to fix your reputation?
- [Hyo-man] What the heck?

11:03.621 --> 11:06.957
I'm just doing what Si-eun asked me to do,
to help you guys out.

11:07.041 --> 11:08.292
He asked me for a favor.

11:09.377 --> 11:11.253
[Jun-tae] I'm not gonna forgive you.

11:15.216 --> 11:16.342
Every single day,

11:18.636 --> 11:21.180
you bullied and tortured us.

11:22.807 --> 11:24.308
You shouldn't have done that.

11:25.184 --> 11:26.519
I won't forget it.

11:30.022 --> 11:32.233
But we're going to need you
to help us today.

11:42.326 --> 11:43.369
Let's go.

11:44.620 --> 11:45.454
[Gotak sighs]

11:48.833 --> 11:50.000
Let's go.

11:53.629 --> 11:55.381
[lively chatter and laughter]

12:00.094 --> 12:00.970
Oh.

12:01.679 --> 12:03.681
[music and fighting sound effects]

12:05.266 --> 12:07.268
[joystick rattling]

12:10.438 --> 12:12.982
What's goin' on? Why are you so early?

12:14.108 --> 12:15.484
It wasn't that urgent.

12:22.074 --> 12:23.159
Ah. Shit.

12:26.620 --> 12:27.788
[sighs]

12:29.123 --> 12:30.291
[game music stops]

12:32.334 --> 12:33.919
This is our burner phone.

12:34.545 --> 12:36.964
The app has the entire transaction.

12:37.047 --> 12:38.758
Everything in here is original.

12:39.800 --> 12:42.511
You're gonna need this
to end Baek-jin, right?

12:48.893 --> 12:51.061
Why are you always trying so hard?

12:52.229 --> 12:54.231
[tense music playing]

12:57.443 --> 13:01.197
If you want nobody to get hurt,
then why don't you just get hurt?

13:02.072 --> 13:03.240
Ooh!

13:04.575 --> 13:05.493
Relax.

13:07.536 --> 13:10.331
- Relax, man.
- [Seong-je] You know, it felt weird.

13:11.832 --> 13:14.001
I almost became some kinda good guy.

13:16.170 --> 13:18.506
Stuff like this is more fun for me.

13:20.508 --> 13:21.592
[laughs]

13:23.511 --> 13:24.678
[Si-eun yelps]

13:27.181 --> 13:28.349
[Seong-je laughs]

13:30.935 --> 13:32.603
- [sighs]
- [thud]

13:32.686 --> 13:34.688
[lively chatter]

13:46.075 --> 13:48.619
Did you all come running
when you heard about a fight?

13:48.702 --> 13:50.246
[laughter]

13:51.664 --> 13:54.458
Thanks, everyone, for showin' up.

13:58.128 --> 14:00.130
[lively chatter resumes]

14:02.842 --> 14:03.884
Where is Si-eun?

14:04.468 --> 14:05.386
[Jun-tae] Huh?

14:06.846 --> 14:09.265
His phone was busy,
so I thought he was with you.

14:15.437 --> 14:17.606
YEON SI-EUN:
I'M STOPPING BY THE BOWLING CLUB

14:17.690 --> 14:19.692
Si-eun says he went to the bowling club.

14:25.406 --> 14:27.783
[female voice] The number you have dialed
is not available.

14:27.867 --> 14:29.410
Please leave a message after the--

14:30.035 --> 14:31.954
Si-eun's phone's turned off.

14:32.037 --> 14:36.083
Oh shit. You think the Union assholes
are trying to trap us?

14:37.710 --> 14:39.545
[Jun-tae] Uh, I'll go to the bowling club.

14:40.963 --> 14:42.464
You two should stay here.

14:42.965 --> 14:44.675
[mysterious music playing]

14:44.758 --> 14:46.510
I'll go get Si-eun, okay?

14:51.849 --> 14:52.975
Hurry back.

14:53.517 --> 14:54.518
Mmm.

14:57.229 --> 14:58.606
[panting]

15:04.278 --> 15:05.946
[dramatic music playing]

15:41.357 --> 15:43.233
[music fades]

16:06.799 --> 16:08.133
Na Baek-jin!

16:12.596 --> 16:14.181
If you lose today,

16:15.349 --> 16:17.434
that'll be the end of the Union.

16:18.310 --> 16:19.770
Understand?

16:24.108 --> 16:25.234
Kill them all.

16:27.778 --> 16:29.363
[giggles]

16:32.282 --> 16:33.742
I'm claiming Na Baek-jin.

16:34.493 --> 16:36.328
Handle everybody else, all right?

16:38.288 --> 16:39.373
[Hyo-man] Okay!

16:41.125 --> 16:42.251
Okay!

16:42.334 --> 16:44.712
[all yelling]

16:46.380 --> 16:48.090
Let's go!

16:49.049 --> 16:50.926
[dramatic music playing]

17:03.731 --> 17:05.441
[grunting]

17:14.783 --> 17:16.118
[Hyo-man] Hey, fucker!

17:25.919 --> 17:27.629
[yelling]

17:50.694 --> 17:52.362
- [cracking]
- [yells]

17:59.244 --> 18:00.496
[sighs]

18:02.414 --> 18:03.665
[music stops]

18:07.419 --> 18:08.670
[tape squeaking]

18:12.508 --> 18:14.676
[Union boy] Shit,
how do I fucking do this?

18:15.219 --> 18:16.220
[yelps]

18:16.804 --> 18:17.888
[groans]

18:17.971 --> 18:19.890
Fuck you, man.

18:19.973 --> 18:21.725
[energetic music playing]

18:24.478 --> 18:27.314
Fucking hell. Come here, you little shit.

18:27.397 --> 18:28.482
- [yells] Fuck!
- [thump]

18:28.565 --> 18:30.317
[tires squealing]

18:32.528 --> 18:33.654
[Jun-tae] Thank you.

18:41.703 --> 18:42.704
[gasps]

18:45.707 --> 18:47.042
[panting]

18:49.086 --> 18:50.003
[Jun-tae] Si-eun-a.

18:50.963 --> 18:51.922
Are you okay?

18:53.298 --> 18:54.716
How did you get here?

18:56.301 --> 18:57.970
Come on, let's get out of here.

18:58.971 --> 19:00.264
[suspenseful music playing]

19:00.347 --> 19:02.474
[panting]

19:02.558 --> 19:04.059
[Jun-tae grunts softly]

19:09.273 --> 19:10.315
[grunting]

19:10.399 --> 19:13.443
[Union boy] Try harder.
I'm gonna fucking kill you!

19:13.527 --> 19:16.155
You're done, you asshole.
I'm gonna fucking end you.

19:16.238 --> 19:17.364
[wails]

19:18.073 --> 19:20.325
- [Jun-tae grunting]
- [Union boy shrieks]

19:21.618 --> 19:23.370
[both grunting loudly]

19:23.453 --> 19:24.955
[gasps]

19:25.664 --> 19:27.249
[Union boy roars]

19:30.419 --> 19:32.588
[groans]

19:42.764 --> 19:43.724
[growls]

19:43.807 --> 19:45.267
[yells]

19:46.977 --> 19:48.812
[Si-eun panting shakily]

19:52.524 --> 19:54.151
[Jun-tae groans]

19:56.987 --> 19:59.156
Jun-tae-ya. You okay?

20:00.908 --> 20:02.034
I'm fine.

20:03.577 --> 20:04.828
We need to hurry.

20:07.414 --> 20:08.624
[yelps]

20:10.125 --> 20:10.959
[gasping]

20:13.045 --> 20:14.963
I'll follow. You go ahead.

20:16.131 --> 20:17.591
- You need the hospital.
- No, I'm good.

20:17.674 --> 20:19.468
I just need a second, that's all.

20:20.260 --> 20:22.512
[panting] Please go.

20:25.390 --> 20:26.433
You need to go

20:27.351 --> 20:29.478
and help them stop fighting for good.

20:33.815 --> 20:34.816
Mmm.

20:35.567 --> 20:37.027
[breathing shakily]

20:44.743 --> 20:46.745
[dramatic music playing]

20:59.174 --> 21:00.133
[gasping]

21:02.552 --> 21:04.263
Stay down. Asshole.

21:04.346 --> 21:05.430
Shut up.

21:06.056 --> 21:09.101
Hey, cut out your fucking bullshit.

21:10.519 --> 21:11.603
[growls]

21:12.396 --> 21:13.480
Come on.

21:16.275 --> 21:18.068
[grunting]

21:45.262 --> 21:46.263
[sighs]

21:46.346 --> 21:48.098
[panting]

21:51.810 --> 21:53.812
- [Hyo-man] Asshole!
- [Dong-ha] You shit!

21:55.314 --> 21:56.815
[both wailing]

21:58.025 --> 21:59.568
[Dong-ha] Ow! What the fuck?

22:01.903 --> 22:03.155
Come on, you asshole!

22:03.655 --> 22:05.240
[Hyo-man] Eat my shit, fucker!

22:05.324 --> 22:08.994
Oh! You stupid jerk-face fucker!

22:09.077 --> 22:11.121
Hey, you! Hey! Come on.

22:11.204 --> 22:12.789
What? Come on!

22:12.873 --> 22:13.957
Asshole!

22:14.041 --> 22:15.334
[yelps]

22:15.417 --> 22:16.752
[screams]

22:17.336 --> 22:18.754
[yelping]

22:18.837 --> 22:21.423
[Dong-ha] Son of a bitch!
Stop fucking around!

22:27.429 --> 22:28.722
[boy yells]

22:41.610 --> 22:43.612
[dramatic music playing]

23:21.191 --> 23:22.192
[both grunt]

23:22.275 --> 23:24.653
[grunting]

23:34.788 --> 23:36.081
[music fades]

23:36.164 --> 23:38.375
[sounds echoing]

23:47.259 --> 23:50.429
Hey, Baek-jin-a, you've improved a lot.

23:51.638 --> 23:55.267
[chuckles] But this isn't why
I taught you how to fight.

23:56.017 --> 23:57.394
Phew.

23:58.311 --> 23:59.688
I'll end this for you.

24:00.939 --> 24:02.941
[tense music playing]

24:19.875 --> 24:22.127
[sounds become muffled and echo]

24:30.385 --> 24:32.387
[sounds return]

24:41.771 --> 24:42.939
[Baku] It hurt, right?

24:44.608 --> 24:46.610
[laughs]

24:48.403 --> 24:49.488
[yells]

25:00.332 --> 25:01.416
[yells]

25:02.334 --> 25:03.251
[yells]

25:04.252 --> 25:05.754
[yells]

25:07.297 --> 25:09.424
[grunting]

25:19.351 --> 25:21.144
- [grunts]
- [sounds fade]

25:24.856 --> 25:27.025
[echoing roar]

25:27.108 --> 25:29.110
[high-pitched ringing]

25:45.460 --> 25:46.878
[ringing fades]

25:48.380 --> 25:50.090
[poignant music playing]

25:50.799 --> 25:52.133
[young Baku] Na Baek-jin,

25:53.009 --> 25:54.094
are you all right?

26:04.813 --> 26:08.066
Hey. Why are you always getting beat up?

26:12.612 --> 26:14.489
Hold your fists real tight.

26:15.657 --> 26:17.242
Don't avoid their eyes.

26:19.953 --> 26:22.289
[poignant music continues over silence]

27:05.540 --> 27:07.542
[muffled blow echoes]

27:16.092 --> 27:17.844
[muffled thud]

27:52.420 --> 27:54.339
[music fades]

27:54.422 --> 27:56.424
[sounds of fight return]

27:59.678 --> 28:00.679
Hey!

28:01.763 --> 28:03.598
Na Baek-jin won!

28:03.682 --> 28:05.558
[grunting]

28:05.642 --> 28:06.726
[boy 1] That's enough!

28:08.395 --> 28:10.271
It's all over, you shits!

28:10.355 --> 28:11.940
[boy 2] Na Baek-jin won!

28:12.023 --> 28:14.401
[boy 3] Fucking stop fighting!

28:14.484 --> 28:17.278
Baek-jin's won!

28:18.446 --> 28:20.448
[panting]

28:28.581 --> 28:29.833
And now…

28:29.916 --> 28:31.459
[suspenseful music playing]

28:35.964 --> 28:38.091
…Eunjang will belong to the Union.

28:39.759 --> 28:41.386
[breathing heavily]

28:42.387 --> 28:43.430
If you…

28:48.226 --> 28:50.228
cannot accept this decision,

28:53.648 --> 28:54.774
then come out.

28:56.860 --> 28:57.986
Who's next?

28:59.028 --> 29:00.530
Shit, man.

29:02.824 --> 29:05.577
Come out, you pieces of shit!

29:07.203 --> 29:09.038
[breathing shakily]

29:46.326 --> 29:47.786
[music fades]

29:51.539 --> 29:53.249
[Baek-jin] And then there was one.

29:56.169 --> 29:57.504
Yeon Si-eun.

30:01.841 --> 30:02.884
[Baku panting]

30:07.847 --> 30:08.932
[Baek-jin] What?

30:11.851 --> 30:13.478
You like to talk a big game.

30:14.771 --> 30:16.856
Are you scared
to back that up with a fight?

30:21.069 --> 30:23.238
You're the only one who's talking.

30:24.531 --> 30:25.949
I'm here to fight.

30:35.625 --> 30:36.709
[scoffs]

30:42.590 --> 30:44.133
[dramatic music playing]

30:44.217 --> 30:46.052
[Baek-jin] You fucking asshole.

30:48.179 --> 30:50.390
[onlookers gasping]

30:52.934 --> 30:54.227
[Si-eun yells]

30:54.310 --> 30:56.312
[both grunting]

31:11.661 --> 31:13.454
- [roaring]
- [onlookers gasping]

31:16.499 --> 31:18.334
[Baek-jin yelling]

31:35.393 --> 31:37.020
[yelping]

31:38.062 --> 31:39.230
[roars]

31:40.982 --> 31:42.358
[choking]

31:49.949 --> 31:50.950
Nice job!

31:51.034 --> 31:52.452
[gasps]

31:53.328 --> 31:55.163
[panting]

32:06.883 --> 32:07.759
[scoffs]

32:08.468 --> 32:10.011
[laughs]

32:12.597 --> 32:14.057
[pants]

32:14.974 --> 32:16.726
[onlookers gasping]

32:19.020 --> 32:20.605
[grunting]

32:50.551 --> 32:51.719
Yeon Si-eun.

33:08.861 --> 33:10.071
[gasps]

33:14.450 --> 33:15.618
[grunts]

33:17.870 --> 33:19.247
[panting]

33:19.330 --> 33:20.540
[boy 4] Oh shit.

33:21.874 --> 33:23.668
[wheezing]

33:31.217 --> 33:32.969
[grunting]

33:39.684 --> 33:41.894
[panting]

33:43.938 --> 33:45.231
[chuckles softly]

33:47.483 --> 33:48.943
[groans]

33:52.530 --> 33:53.823
- [yells]
- [onlookers gasp]

33:55.575 --> 33:56.951
[yells raggedly]

33:59.620 --> 34:00.621
[grunts]

34:04.459 --> 34:05.793
- [yells]
- [all gasp]

34:08.129 --> 34:10.381
- [gurgling]
- [grunts]

34:10.965 --> 34:12.383
[screaming]

34:12.967 --> 34:14.469
[onlookers gasp]

34:15.136 --> 34:17.138
[energetic music playing]

34:19.766 --> 34:21.350
[Baek-jin wailing]

34:22.018 --> 34:23.811
[screaming]

34:23.895 --> 34:25.396
[squelching]

34:25.480 --> 34:27.231
[Si-eun continues screaming]

34:34.572 --> 34:36.032
[screams]

34:40.745 --> 34:43.456
[roaring]

34:44.165 --> 34:46.250
[sounds become muffled and echoing]

34:47.085 --> 34:48.377
[squelching]

35:00.473 --> 35:01.849
- [cracking]
- [screams]

35:03.476 --> 35:05.353
[onlookers gasping]

35:05.436 --> 35:06.604
[sounds return]

35:22.286 --> 35:23.704
[roars]

35:25.123 --> 35:26.332
[wheezes]

35:32.880 --> 35:34.799
[breathing shakily]

35:36.467 --> 35:38.177
[laughing]

35:41.097 --> 35:42.682
[wheezes]

35:45.434 --> 35:48.187
Baku only came for my arms.
This is part of a plan, isn't it?

35:52.066 --> 35:53.609
My arms and then legs?

35:55.319 --> 35:56.988
What's next in your plan?

35:58.906 --> 36:02.243
How wide is your margin of error,
you goddamn shit?

36:07.790 --> 36:09.125
It's still in.

36:10.418 --> 36:11.586
What?

36:13.671 --> 36:15.756
It's still within the margin of error.

36:18.217 --> 36:20.219
Your limbs are all finished.

36:22.972 --> 36:24.974
[tense music playing]

36:31.939 --> 36:33.024
[sighs]

36:34.525 --> 36:36.444
[Si-eun] If you lose, by any chance,

36:37.570 --> 36:38.863
I'll step in.

36:44.410 --> 36:45.703
Get back up.

36:46.662 --> 36:50.374
Somehow, I'll hold out until you do.

37:03.971 --> 37:05.973
[music fades]

37:06.057 --> 37:07.683
[gasps]

37:13.606 --> 37:16.025
[whimpering]

37:36.128 --> 37:37.380
- [all gasp]
- [boy] Whoa.

37:39.715 --> 37:41.592
[wheezes]

37:44.595 --> 37:46.597
[rain pattering softly]

37:50.309 --> 37:51.310
- Whoa.
- Hey.

37:51.394 --> 37:52.436
We won.

37:52.520 --> 37:54.522
[murmuring]

38:05.908 --> 38:07.118
Baek-jin-a.

38:13.082 --> 38:14.166
I'm sorry.

38:19.839 --> 38:20.881
But…

38:25.136 --> 38:26.971
you should be sorry to me too.

38:40.109 --> 38:41.444
[sighs]

38:47.366 --> 38:48.451
[sighs]

38:53.497 --> 38:54.582
The fight

38:56.292 --> 38:57.418
is over!

38:59.837 --> 39:01.797
[poignant music playing]

39:01.881 --> 39:03.716
[all] It's done!

39:04.467 --> 39:05.426
Nice!

39:05.509 --> 39:07.511
[shouting]

39:11.223 --> 39:13.184
[cheering]

39:18.314 --> 39:20.149
[excited chatter]

39:21.067 --> 39:22.610
[laughter]

39:54.809 --> 39:55.893
[sighs]

39:59.230 --> 40:00.481
[exhales]

40:05.027 --> 40:07.196
[boys talking and laughing]

40:07.905 --> 40:09.907
[Hyo-man] Did you see how amazing I was?

40:09.990 --> 40:12.326
Guys, did you see how amazing I was?

40:12.410 --> 40:13.536
Hear me out! Hear me out!

40:13.619 --> 40:15.955
In that one-on-one fight, I was like, pow!

40:16.038 --> 40:17.415
And I tackled him and, yah!

40:17.498 --> 40:18.958
I'm serious. I'm serious!

40:19.041 --> 40:22.461
It was the coolest thing I've ever
freaking done! Hey, listen to me!

40:25.714 --> 40:27.007
[Baku] Jun-tae-ya!

40:50.406 --> 40:52.408
[poignant music continues]

41:03.043 --> 41:05.754
[Si-eun] We completely
knocked out after that.

41:09.383 --> 41:14.180
Like as if we were catching up
on all the sleep we had missed.

41:16.724 --> 41:18.559
- [Jun-tae] No way.
- [Gotak] I didn't say that.

41:18.642 --> 41:21.729
- [Jun-tae] Oh my gosh. Come on.
- [Baku] Hey. Cut it out, you little shit.

41:21.812 --> 41:24.023
But I only made one mistake yesterday!

41:24.106 --> 41:26.692
[Baku] Hey, there! Yeon Si-eun!

41:26.775 --> 41:28.444
[laughs]

41:31.739 --> 41:33.574
[Jun-tae] You know
I'm just messing with you.

41:33.657 --> 41:35.201
- [Si-eun] And then…
- [Jun-tae] Let's go.

41:35.284 --> 41:37.495
…somehow, we became seniors.

41:37.578 --> 41:38.913
[Jun-tae] …gave me her address.

41:38.996 --> 41:40.289
[Baku] That photo looks great.

41:40.372 --> 41:41.916
PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE
WHO UNITED EUNJANG

41:41.999 --> 41:43.125
[Jun-tae] Who'd vote for him?

41:43.209 --> 41:45.211
[poignant music continues]

41:46.629 --> 41:47.755
[Si-eun] After that,

41:48.506 --> 41:51.383
rumors went around
that Baek-jin had disappeared.

41:53.844 --> 41:55.679
No one had any idea…

41:58.933 --> 42:00.392
of where he went.

42:03.437 --> 42:04.730
Will Na Baek-jin…

42:05.231 --> 42:06.774
[laughter]

42:06.857 --> 42:08.526
…find the right answer

42:10.069 --> 42:12.196
to the question he had gotten wrong?

42:15.199 --> 42:16.283
[sighs]

42:16.367 --> 42:17.868
[music fades]

42:19.411 --> 42:21.580
[Gotak] 1-0. All by yourself!

42:21.664 --> 42:23.666
What are you spacing out so hard about?

42:27.169 --> 42:28.546
Aah!

42:31.632 --> 42:33.384
Nothing important.

42:34.969 --> 42:36.303
[Baku chuckles]

42:37.304 --> 42:40.057
Oh wow, the weather is so nice.

42:40.140 --> 42:41.308
So peaceful.

42:41.392 --> 42:43.143
- [players yelling]
- [phone buzzing]

42:49.775 --> 42:52.403
[Gotak] Hey! My ball. My ball, my ball!

42:53.904 --> 42:55.906
- Hello?
- [players cheering and clapping]

42:55.990 --> 42:57.992
[emotional music playing]

43:31.108 --> 43:32.693
[breathing shakily]

43:46.874 --> 43:47.916
Say hi.

43:59.386 --> 44:00.596
♪ Awake ♪

44:03.724 --> 44:06.352
♪ Awakening ♪

44:10.773 --> 44:14.735
♪ From a dream I ♪

44:16.612 --> 44:18.364
♪ Never thought ♪

44:19.239 --> 44:20.741
♪ Would end ♪

44:34.338 --> 44:35.506
You been all right?

44:39.593 --> 44:41.136
[breathing shakily]

44:46.433 --> 44:47.518
Mm-hm.

44:54.024 --> 44:55.734
Who are those guys behind you?

45:01.198 --> 45:02.449
[Si-eun] My friends.

45:14.086 --> 45:15.337
That's awesome.

45:25.597 --> 45:28.100
[breathes shakily]

45:31.353 --> 45:36.400
♪ I am dreaming ♪

45:37.484 --> 45:42.406
♪ I am dreaming ♪

45:43.157 --> 45:48.787
♪ Now I'm dreaming ♪

45:48.871 --> 45:55.210
♪ For tomorrow, I am here ♪

45:55.294 --> 46:00.924
♪ I can feel everything ♪

46:01.008 --> 46:06.638
♪ And I can go anywhere ♪

46:06.722 --> 46:11.643
♪ I want you to know that… ♪

46:13.020 --> 46:14.271
[music fades]

46:21.069 --> 46:22.321
[sighs]

46:25.657 --> 46:26.909
[sighs]

46:27.659 --> 46:29.328
[Choi] You're Baek-jin's friend?

46:35.834 --> 46:36.919
[Seong-je] Yeah.

46:37.920 --> 46:39.296
Something like that.

46:53.227 --> 46:54.311
[Choi] Well,

46:55.187 --> 46:56.855
I need Baek-jin's replacement.

46:58.315 --> 47:01.944
CHEONGANG

47:02.027 --> 47:04.988
[Choi] No child's play
like this bowling club.

47:06.740 --> 47:08.492
Is it fun working for you?

47:09.243 --> 47:12.746
Making money isn't fun. It's hard work.

47:15.541 --> 47:16.583
[Seong-je sighs]

47:19.378 --> 47:21.463
That doesn't sound very romantic.

47:25.092 --> 47:27.094
[Choi laughing]

47:31.557 --> 47:33.308
[Seong-je] By the way, have you…

47:36.186 --> 47:37.771
have you heard from Baek-jin?

47:39.064 --> 47:41.024
I can't get ahold of that fucker.

47:42.067 --> 47:43.610
Who knows?

47:44.111 --> 47:45.904
I'm curious too, kid.

47:45.988 --> 47:47.990
[emotional music playing]

47:53.161 --> 47:56.790
CHEONGANG

47:56.874 --> 47:59.042
[music continues over silence]

48:29.865 --> 48:34.870
THE LATE NA BAEK-JIN

48:49.301 --> 48:51.303
[song lyrics in Korean]

52:03.912 --> 52:05.372
[song fades]

52:06.915 --> 52:08.917
[calm, poignant music playing]
